[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13981.91, "timestamp": "03:53:01", "text": "或者像指南之类的东西，教人怎么做，呃……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13984.71, "timestamp": "03:53:04", "text": "Twitch 直播主播的礼品和其他东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13988.07, "timestamp": "03:53:08", "text": "该做什么等等。就在那时，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13991.189, "timestamp": "03:53:11", "text": "学到了，是的，就像所有的一切"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13993.59, "timestamp": "03:53:13", "text": "这些东西。你必须这样做才能保持"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13996.15, "timestamp": "03:53:16", "text": "说话而不是一直保持沉默"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13999.349, "timestamp": "03:53:19", "text": "时间。总会有人走运的。回来"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14001.67, "timestamp": "03:53:21", "text": "当时，我不知道“follow for”是什么意思。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14004.55, "timestamp": "03:53:24", "text": "这有多糟糕啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14007.269, "timestamp": "03:53:27", "text": "有那些东西之类的。我不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14009.11, "timestamp": "03:53:29", "text": "看到这种情况发生"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14010.79, "timestamp": "03:53:30", "text": "如今。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14012.95, "timestamp": "03:53:32", "text": "很久以前，这确实是一种现象。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14014.79, "timestamp": "03:53:34", "text": "以前每个人都会这样做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14019.269, "timestamp": "03:53:39", "text": "关注这个，是的，很多次"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14023.349, "timestamp": "03:53:43", "text": "我认为它正在变得更加……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14027.59, "timestamp": "03:53:47", "text": "不直接说，我会说h"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14029.51, "timestamp": "03:53:49", "text": "嗯，它变得更加间接了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14032.63, "timestamp": "03:53:52", "text": "推特上的帖子就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14036.55, "timestamp": "03:53:56", "text": "有点像被封面覆盖着"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14038.87, "timestamp": "03:53:58", "text": "比如参与度，还有比如……"}]